      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792703816432,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "sees IP + port, forwards CONNECTIONS\n(bytes). Can't read Host or path.\nWith TLS passthrough: at most the SNI.\nAWS NLB, kube-proxy, your Go LB",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "sees IP + port, forwards CONNECTIONS\n(bytes). Can't read Host or path.\nWith TLS passthrough: at most the SNI.\nAWS NLB, kube-proxy, your Go LB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
